    <string name="about_project_intro">The module is a modern Xposed module written against the libxposed 102 API, and its interface is adapted from the KernelSU manager Miuix implementation. This app is the module manager: it reports the framework connection, keeps the LSPosed scope in sync and hosts the appearance settings.</string>
